msgid ""
"The \\\"filter expression\\\" option enables filtering using an advanced "
"expression that allows specifying a mix of IDs and range of IDs. For "
"example:<br /><br />234,345,450-576,800,900-1005<br /><br />This will filter"
" IDs 234,345 and 800 and also the range of IDs between 450 and 576 and the "
"range of IDs between 900 and 1005. The range includes the limiting values, "
"e.g. 450 and 576."
